{"seq":3,"slug":"recursion-and-tail-call","title":"递归与尾调用","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/functional-programming/core-concepts/recursion-and-tail-call","wordCount":1051,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"递归与尾调用\">递归与尾调用</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>在没有可变循环的函数式世界里，<strong>递归</strong>是表达迭代的手段；而<strong>尾调用</strong>决定了递归能否安全地规模化。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>关键点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>递归</td>\n<td>函数调用自身处理更小规模的问题</td>\n<td>必须有可达的基准情况</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>尾调用</td>\n<td>函数的最后一个操作是调用另一个函数</td>\n<td>栈帧可复用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>尾递归</td>\n<td>尾调用的是自身</td>\n<td>配合累积器把中间结果传下去</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TCO</td>\n<td>编译器把尾调用优化成跳转</td>\n<td>JavaScript 生态几乎未实现</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Trampoline</td>\n<td>用循环反复执行返回的 thunk</td>\n<td>不支持 TCO 时的栈安全方案</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>递归关心&quot;把问题拆小&quot;，尾递归关心&quot;把栈抹平&quot;。两者一起，才让函数式循环既有声明式的清晰，又不至于撑爆调用栈。</p>\n<h2 id=\"递归-函数式的循环\">递归：函数式的循环</h2><p>在函数式编程中，递归是替代命令式循环的核心控制流机制。递归函数通过调用自身来处理问题的子结构，直到到达基准情况（Base Case）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const factorial = (n: number): number =&gt; (n &lt;= 1 ? 1 : n * factorial(n - 1));&#10;&#10;const fibonacci = (n: number): number =&gt; (n &lt;= 1 ? n : fibonacci(n - 1) + fibonacci(n - 2));\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> factorial</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">n</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (n </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ?</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> :</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> factorial</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(n </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> fibonacci</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">n</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (n </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ?</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> fibonacci</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(n </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> fibonacci</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(n </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">));</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"haskell\" data-code=\"factorial :: Integer -&gt; Integer&#10;factorial 0 = 1&#10;factorial n = n * factorial (n - 1)&#10;&#10;fibonacci :: Integer -&gt; Integer&#10;fibonacci 0 = 0&#10;fibonacci 1 = 1&#10;fibonacci n = fibonacci (n - 1) + fibonacci (n - 2)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>factorial :: Integer -> Integer</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>factorial 0 = 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>factorial n = n * factorial (n - 1)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fibonacci :: Integer -> Integer</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fibonacci 0 = 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fibonacci 1 = 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fibonacci n = fibonacci (n - 1) + fibonacci (n - 2)</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>对比维度</th>\n<th>命令式循环</th>\n<th>递归</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>状态管理</td>\n<td>可变计数器</td>\n<td>函数参数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>终止条件</td>\n<td>循环条件</td>\n<td>基准情况</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可读性</td>\n<td>取决于复杂度</td>\n<td>声明式，接近数学定义</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>栈空间</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>编译器优化</td>\n<td>已优化</td>\n<td>需要尾调用优化</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    F5[&quot;factorial(5)&quot;] --&gt; M5[&quot;5 × factorial(4)&quot;]&#10;    M5 --&gt; F4[&quot;factorial(4)&quot;]&#10;    F4 --&gt; M4[&quot;4 × factorial(3)&quot;]&#10;    M4 --&gt; F3[&quot;factorial(3)&quot;]&#10;    F3 --&gt; M3[&quot;3 × factorial(2)&quot;]&#10;    M3 --&gt; F2[&quot;factorial(2)&quot;]&#10;    F2 --&gt; M2[&quot;2 × factorial(1)&quot;]&#10;    M2 --&gt; F1[&quot;factorial(1) = 1&quot;]\">graph TD\n    F5[\"factorial(5)\"] --&gt; M5[\"5 × factorial(4)\"]\n    M5 --&gt; F4[\"factorial(4)\"]\n    F4 --&gt; M4[\"4 × factorial(3)\"]\n    M4 --&gt; F3[\"factorial(3)\"]\n    F3 --&gt; M3[\"3 × factorial(2)\"]\n    M3 --&gt; F2[\"factorial(2)\"]\n    F2 --&gt; M2[\"2 × factorial(1)\"]\n    M2 --&gt; F1[\"factorial(1) = 1\"]</pre><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 递归的关键在于两点：一是确保基准情况能够被到达（否则无限递归），二是每次递归调用都在缩小问题规模。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"尾调用与尾递归\">尾调用与尾递归</h2><p><strong>尾调用</strong>（Tail Call）是指函数的最后一个操作是调用另一个函数。当这个被调用的函数是自身时，称为<strong>尾递归</strong>（Tail Recursion）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const factorialNaive = (n: number): number =&gt; (n &lt;= 1 ? 1 : n * factorialNaive(n - 1));&#10;&#10;const factorialTail = (n: number, acc: number = 1): number =&gt; (n &lt;= 1 ? acc : factorialTail(n - 1, n * acc));\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> factorialNaive</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">n</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (n </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ?</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> :</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> factorialNaive</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(n </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> factorialTail</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">n</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">acc</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (n </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ?</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> acc </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> factorialTail</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(n </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, n </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> acc));</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"haskell\" data-code=\"factorialTail :: Integer -&gt; Integer -&gt; Integer&#10;factorialTail 0 acc = acc&#10;factorialTail n acc = factorialTail (n - 1) (n * acc)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>factorialTail :: Integer -> Integer -> Integer</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>factorialTail 0 acc = acc</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>factorialTail n acc = factorialTail (n - 1) (n * acc)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>两种递归方式的调用栈对比：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>调用层</th>\n<th>普通递归 <code>factorial(5)</code></th>\n<th>尾递归 <code>factorialTail(5, 1)</code></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>第 1 层</td>\n<td><code>5 * factorial(4)</code></td>\n<td><code>factorialTail(4, 5)</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>第 2 层</td>\n<td><code>4 * factorial(3)</code></td>\n<td><code>factorialTail(3, 20)</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>第 3 层</td>\n<td><code>3 * factorial(2)</code></td>\n<td><code>factorialTail(2, 60)</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>第 4 层</td>\n<td><code>2 * factorial(1)</code></td>\n<td><code>factorialTail(1, 120)</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>第 5 层</td>\n<td><code>1</code></td>\n<td><code>120</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>栈深度</td>\n<td>O(n) — 展开后回收</td>\n<td>O(1) — 可被 TCO 优化</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph 普通递归&#10;        S1[帧 1] --&gt; S2[帧 2] --&gt; S3[帧 3] --&gt; S4[帧 4] --&gt; S5[帧 5]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 尾递归 + TCO&#10;        T1[帧 1] --&gt;|复用| T1&#10;    end\">graph LR\n    subgraph 普通递归\n        S1[帧 1] --&gt; S2[帧 2] --&gt; S3[帧 3] --&gt; S4[帧 4] --&gt; S5[帧 5]\n    end\n    subgraph 尾递归 + TCO\n        T1[帧 1] --&gt;|复用| T1\n    end</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"尾调用优化\">尾调用优化</h2><p><strong>尾调用优化</strong>（Tail Call Optimization，TCO）是编译器/运行时将尾调用转换为跳转指令的优化，使递归函数不再消耗额外栈空间。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>语言/运行时</th>\n<th>TCO 支持</th>\n<th>备注</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Haskell</td>\n<td>✅ 完整</td>\n<td>惰性求值 + 编译器优化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Scheme</td>\n<td>✅ 规范要求</td>\n<td>R5RS 起强制要求</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Erlang/Elixir</td>\n<td>✅ 完整</td>\n<td>BEAM 虚拟机原生支持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Scala</td>\n<td>✅ @tailrec</td>\n<td>编译器注解验证</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Rust</td>\n<td>⚠️ 部分</td>\n<td>某些情况下 LLVM 优化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>JavaScript</td>\n<td>⚠️ 仅 Safari</td>\n<td>ES2015 规范但几乎未实现</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TypeScript</td>\n<td>❌ 运行时决定</td>\n<td>取决于目标 JS 引擎</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Python</td>\n<td>❌ 明确拒绝</td>\n<td>Guido 反对 TCO</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 尽管 ES2015 规范要求尾调用优化，但截至目前只有 Safari/WebKit 完整实现。在 Node.js 和 Chrome 中编写尾递归并不会获得栈空间优化。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"trampoline-模式\">Trampoline 模式</h2><p>在不支持 TCO 的语言中，<strong>Trampoline</strong> 模式通过将递归调用转换为循环来避免栈溢出。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"type Thunk&lt;A&gt; = () =&gt; A | Thunk&lt;A&gt;;&#10;&#10;const trampoline = &lt;A&gt;(fn: Thunk&lt;A&gt;): A =&gt; {&#10;  let result: A | Thunk&lt;A&gt; = fn;&#10;  while (typeof result === &#39;function&#39;) {&#10;    result = (result as Thunk&lt;A&gt;)();&#10;  }&#10;  return result;&#10;};&#10;&#10;const factorialTrampoline = (n: number, acc: number = 1): number | (() =&gt; number | (() =&gt; any)) =&gt;&#10;  n &lt;= 1 ? acc : () =&gt; factorialTrampoline(n - 1, n * acc);&#10;&#10;const result = trampoline(() =&gt; factorialTrampoline(100000, 1));\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Thunk</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">A</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> A</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Thunk</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">A</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"col